# ============================================================================
# RSU / Schedule FA tool - .gitignore
#
# This repository is source code and configuration ONLY. Real client data -
# uploaded broker statements, generated client working papers, and anything
# derived from them - must never be committed, even to a private repository.
#
# See claude/rsu-fa-github-privacy-review.md (project docs) for the full
# privacy audit this file implements.
# ============================================================================

# --- Client data: never commit -------------------------------------------
# Per-client account/entity registers, real names, real account numbers.
/clients/
# Uploaded broker statements (PDF/XLSX/CSV) - the source documents themselves.
/uploads/
# Generated Schedule FA workbooks - completed client deliverables.
/output/
# Job workspaces (web UI runs, acceptance-harness runs) - copies of the above.
/work/

# --- Sensitive test fixtures: real client tax data ------------------------
# Confirmed real client data (UBS account, address, entity, actual rupee
# figures) captured for the acceptance harness. Digest c6acdbbd43aeda76 is
# recorded in claude/rsu-fa-freeze-record.md; this file itself must stay off
# GitHub and must not be regenerated to "fix" this ignore rule.
tests/fixtures/acceptance_baseline.json
# Real Grant Number / Order Number values tied to an actual person's vest
# history, inside a binary workbook fixture that cannot be redacted without
# risking the byte-for-byte parsing test it supports.
tests/fixtures/etrade_GL_Expanded_INTC.xlsx

# --- Licensed / preparer-supplied FX tables --------------------------------
# FBIL is licensed benchmark data (End-Users Licence, fee-liable) and is only
# ever preparer-supplied, never auto-fetched. ECB and Google Finance tables
# populated from real historical data are working files, not source code.
config/fx_fbil.csv
config/fx_ecb.csv
config/fx_google_finance.csv

# --- Python / build artifacts ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- OS / editor cruft -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# --- Ad hoc scratch output the engine/tests write at the repo root ---------
/*.xlsx
